# Artscout - 2026: OpenAL Soft -- track only what the build consumes.
#
# Falcon4.vcxproj links src\extlibs\openal\libs\win64\OpenAL32.lib in every configuration and
# post-builds an UNCONDITIONAL copy of bin\win64\soft_oal.dll to OutDir\OpenAL32.dll, so those two
# have to be in the tree or a fresh clone does not build. The licences go with them because the DLL
# is redistributed. Everything below is upstream's distribution tooling that nothing references:
#   alsoft-config  Qt configuration GUI (34 MB)
#   router         the dsound/winmm compatibility router
#   makemhr        HRTF data compiler, and hrtf_defs its .def inputs -- authoring, not runtime;
#                  there is no hrtf\ directory, so soft_oal.dll uses its built-in default set
#   presets        .ambdec ambisonic decoders, loaded only for speaker-array output
#   cxx-modules    C++20 module interface units, unused by this build
#   Win32          x64 only here, and every configuration links libs\win64
src/extlibs/openal/alsoft-config/
src/extlibs/openal/router/
src/extlibs/openal/makemhr/
src/extlibs/openal/hrtf_defs/
src/extlibs/openal/presets/
src/extlibs/openal/cxx-modules/
src/extlibs/openal/openal-info32.exe
src/extlibs/openal/bin/Win32/
src/extlibs/openal/libs/Win32/

# Artscout - 2026: st80conv build output. It builds from src\tools\st80conv\st80conv.vcxproj, and
# Falcon4.vcxproj's copy of it is `if exist` guarded, so an absent exe degrades quietly.
src/tools/st80conv/bin/

# Artscout - 2026: release artifacts from tools\patchuild_patch_zip.ps1
dist/
